# Layout Components Guidelines

## Overview

The ONE framework uses a flexible panel-based layout system with five main sections:
- **Left**: Navigation, sidebar content
- **Top**: Header, global navigation
- **Center**: Main content area
- **Bottom**: Footer, controls
- **Right**: Contextual information, chat

## Layout Structure

The main Layout.astro file should orchestrate these panels and handle their visibility:

```astro
---
// src/layouts/Layout.astro
import Left from '../components/layout/Left.astro';
import Top from '../components/layout/Top.astro';
import Center from '../components/layout/Center.astro';
import Bottom from '../components/layout/Bottom.astro';
import Right from '../components/layout/Right.astro';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
  leftPanelMode?: 'full' | 'half' | 'quarter' | 'hidden';
  rightPanelMode?: 'full' | 'half' | 'quarter' | 'hidden';
  topPanelMode?: 'visible' | 'hidden';
  bottomPanelMode?: 'visible' | 'hidden';
  chatConfig?: any;
}

const {
  title,
  description = "ONE Framework",
  leftPanelMode = 'quarter',
  rightPanelMode = 'hidden',
  topPanelMode = 'visible',
  bottomPanelMode = 'visible',
  chatConfig,
} = Astro.props;
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <!-- Other head elements -->
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="layout-container">
      {leftPanelMode !== 'hidden' && (
        <div class={`left-panel ${leftPanelMode}`}>
          <Left />
        </div>
      )}
      
      {topPanelMode !== 'hidden' && (
        <div class="top-panel">
          <Top />
        </div>
      )}
      
      <div class="center-panel">
        <Center>
          <slot />
        </Center>
      </div>
      
      {bottomPanelMode !== 'hidden' && (
        <div class="bottom-panel">
          <Bottom />
        </div>
      )}
      
      {rightPanelMode !== 'hidden' && (
        <div class={`right-panel ${rightPanelMode}`}>
          <Right chatConfig={chatConfig} />
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
```

## Panel Components

### Left Panel

```astro
---
// src/components/layout/Left.astro
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon';
---

<div class="left-panel-container">
  <div class="logo">
    <a href="/">
      <Icon name="logo" width="32" height="32" />
    </a>
  </div>
  
  <nav class="main-navigation">
    <!-- Navigation items -->
  </nav>
  
  <div class="panel-footer">
    <!-- Footer content -->
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .left-panel-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: var(--panel-bg);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }
  
  .logo {
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  
  .main-navigation {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  
  .panel-footer {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }
</style>
```

### Top Panel

```astro
---
// src/components/layout/Top.astro
import ThemeToggle from '../ThemeToggle';
import Search from '../Search';
---

<div class="top-panel-container">
  <div class="left-section">
    <!-- Left section content -->
  </div>
  
